        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Reguitti SDK096PV/PA Contemporary Rectangle Double Pocket Door Lock Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nVery contemporary rectangular double pocket door privacy lock set that offers high fashion and high quality function. Packaged as a complete set that includes the privacy mortise lock body, two (2) rectangle flush pulls for lock, two (2) rectangle flush pulls for non locking door, two (2) square edge pulls, a strike plate and all mounting hardware. Made in Italy by Reguitti.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in high quality finishes for double pocket doors up to <b>2-1/4\" thick</b>. The square edge pulls are pressure mounted into the doors edge. The rectangle flush pulls are installed with concealed screw mounting for that clean contemporary appearance.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Privacy Lock:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via an emergency turn. A privacy lock does not offer security, it offers privacy.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available for single pocket doors: \r\n<a href=\"/products/contemporary-rectangle-pocket-lock-privacy-reguitti-sdk096pv\"><b>Contemporary Rectangle Pocket Lock Privacy</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/contemporary-rectangle-pocket-door-passage-set-reguitti-sdk096pa\"><b>Contemporary Rectangle Pocket Door Pull Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe privacy mortise lock is installed on one door. The strike plate is installed on the other door. When locked, the two pocket doors are tightly hooked together. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the SDK096PV/PA Contemporary Rectangle Pocket Lock Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mortise Lock Body Height: 1-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Lock Body Thickness: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Lock Body Depth: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Lock Faceplate Height: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Total Height: 4-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Total Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Total Depth: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Door Cutout Depth:  3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Projection: 3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Door Cutout Height: 3-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Door Cutout Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/contemporary-square-fingertip-edge-pull-ahi-ep1273\">Square Edge Pull</a>: 1-1/8\" Square</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDK096PV.pdf?v=1691093348\" target=\"new\"><b>SDK096PV/PA Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDK068PV-SDK096PV-template.pdf?v=1691093348\" target=\"new\"><b>SDK096PV Instalation Template (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use on double (french) pocket sliding doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Note:</b> The flush pulls <b>project 3/16\" off the door's face</b>. If you intend to use on a <b>pocket door</b>, please insure that you have <b>more than 3/16\" clearance</b> between the door's face and the wall pocket.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> privacy mortise lock body, two (2) rectangle flush pulls for lock, two (2) rectangle flush pulls for non locking door, two (2) square edge pulls, strike plate and all mounting hardware. <b>For One Pair of Pocket Doors. (2 doors)</b>\r\n</p>",
